OL,3,APowerful magnitude 7.7 earthquake hits
OL,4,APanama, damaging buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA massive magnitude 7.7 earthquake has
OL,7,Fhit Panama, damaging buildings and
OL,8,Fprompting a wide-ranging tsunami
OL,9,Fwarning for neighbouring countries.
OL,11,FAbout 4.6 million people felt moderate
OL,12,Fto severe shaking as a result of the
OL,13,Fquake, according to the US Geological
OL,14,FSurvey, which has said that the effects
OL,15,Fof the disaster were "likely to be
OL,16,Fwidespread".
OL,18,FThe quake, which hit just before 15:00
OL,19,Flocal time (18:00 GMT), could trigger
OL,20,Ftsunamis in Colombia, Costa Rica, Chile
OL,21,Fand Mexico, according to the US Tsunami
OL,22,FWarning System.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
