OL,3,APowerful magnitude 7.7 earthquake hits
OL,4,APanama, damaging buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe epicentre of the earthquake was
OL,7,Fabout 6.2 miles (10km) from the small
OL,8,Ftown of Pitaloza Arriba in
OL,9,Fsouth-central Panama, with a series of
OL,10,Fshallow aftershocks following it.
